{"title":"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the Queen’s croquet, as described in Problem <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, what is the probability that the ball hits the\ngoal post the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th time the ball is hit?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Zero probability for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e579a04d27acc9a1fc10b6c71fff5607690bd9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{F_{n-1}}{2^{2n}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"40\" height=\"37\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/a/39abfe232e2ed5247aa4028089e5f651090e66da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84c65efa092f022b2e04b08f5b95b20d015f6f88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" /> is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1ef9eff776a35a9a0c4d029a864d64c9181827.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n-1)^{st}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"19\" /> Fibonacci number.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II\">2014 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a hre